   "html": "<div class=\"section-head\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Par où commencer</div>\n<h2>Choisissez un pôle avant de vous lancer</h2>\n</div>\n<a class=\"btn btn-ghost\" href=\"/programmes\">Voir les 21 thématiques →</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"action-grid\">\n<a class=\"pole-card action-tile\" href=\"/programmes#pole-1\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" r=\"2.2\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2.2\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2.2\"></circle><path d=\"M12 7.2v4.3\"></path><path d=\"M6 15.8v-4.3h12v4.3\"></path></svg></span>\n<span class=\"pole-num\">Pôle I · 3 thématiques</span>\n<h3>Mémoire, culture &amp; patrimoine</h3>\n<p>Mémoire, culture, langue et savoirs du peuple bedjond.</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"pole-card action-tile\" href=\"/programmes#pole-2\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 20c0-6 4-10 10-10\"></path><path d=\"M14 10c3 0 6-2 6-6-4 0-6 2-6 6z\"></path><path d=\"M8 20h12\"></path></svg></span>\n<span class=\"pole-num\">Pôle II · 5 thématiques</span>\n<h3>Services essentiels</h3>\n<p>Eau, école, santé, femmes, enfance et protection sociale.</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"pole-card action-tile\" href=\"/programmes#pole-3\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3 4 6v6c0 5 3.5 8 8 9 4.5-1 8-4 8-9V6z\"></path><path d=\"m8.5 12 2.5 2.5L16 10\"></path></svg></span>\n<span class=\"pole-num\">Pôle III · 4 thématiques</span>\n<h3>Gouvernance, paix &amp; plaidoyer</h3>\n<p>Plaidoyer, paix et réseau des cadres et de la diaspora.</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"pole-card action-tile\" href=\"/programmes#pole-4\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M12 10V6M12 14v4M10 12H6M14 12h4\"></path><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span>\n<span class=\"pole-num\">Pôle IV · 3 thématiques</span>\n<h3>Numérique &amp; innovation</h3>\n<p>Services numériques, IA et compétences pour les jeunes.</p>\n</a>\n<a class=\"pole-card action-tile\" href=\"/programmes#pole-5\">\n<span class=\"action-icon\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M3 20h18\"></path><path d=\"M5 20V10l4-3 4 3v10\"></path><path d=\"M13 20v-6h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 13v2\"></path></svg></span>\n<span class=\"pole-num\">Pôle V · 6 thématiques</span>\n<h3>Économie, territoire &amp; risques</h3>\n<p>Agriculture, entreprises, environnement, routes, énergie et urgences.</p>\n</a>\n</div>"
  },
